{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-02-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP TO LAUNCH EVENT CONTRACTS ON BITCOIN FUTURES ON MARCH 13', 'text': 'CHICAGO , FEB. 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD\'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL EXPAND ITS SUITE OF EVENT CONTRACTS TO INCLUDE BITCOIN FUTURES ON MARCH 13, PENDING REGULATORY REVIEW.\xa0\xa0 "OUR NEW EVENT CONTRACTS ON BITCOIN FUTURES PROVIDE A HIGHLY TRANSPARENT AND LESS COMPLEX WAY FOR INVESTORS TO ACCESS CRYPTOCURRENCY MARKETS – WITH THE ADDED BENEFIT OF A FULLY REGULATED PLATFORM," SAID TIM MCCOURT, GLOBAL HEAD OF EQUITY AND FX PRODUCTS AT CME GROUP.'}